WEBVTT

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:30.630
It's dangerous here! 
You should evacuate!

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:33.620
What's the situation?

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:37.010
The enemy has made it inland.

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:40.580
And a second wave is heading for Centezual.

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.270
I will bring her back.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:53.070
Squad 1, keep up!

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:00.830
This isn't your job.

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:02.120
What good can you do?

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:06.920
How can you be so calm?!

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:12.250
There's a trick to it.

00:01:19.110 --> 00:01:21.060
We'll return as quickly as possible.

00:02:57.590 --> 00:03:02.550
<b>Episode 8: 
The Name of the Bird</b>

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:06.490
Multiple enemy fighters...

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:09.230
Thirty small airships!

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:10.500
Kal, look over there!

00:03:11.770 --> 00:03:13.210
The Van Whyl class.

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:17.630
With our main force gone, Isla is defenseless.

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:19.220
We must protect it ourselves!

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:40.010
They're here!

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:45.820
Fausto!

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:47.340
Draw them in...

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:49.160
Draw them as close as you can!

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:03.550
Fire!

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:26.010
We're surrounded!

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:28.550
Defensive formation! Get into 
formation with the others!

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:30.240
Concentrate our fire!

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:41.330
You idiot!

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:43.050
Don't fire yet!

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.140
They'll just slowly rip us apart.

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:00.150
They made it through!

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:02.030
Escorial!

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:06.740
The enemy's second wave

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:08.280
has penetrated our forward defensive lines.

00:05:08.810 --> 00:05:13.940
There are small, enemy airships and hostile 
fighters in the airspace over Escorial.

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:15.620
Where is the <i>Luna Barco</i>?

00:05:15.930 --> 00:05:19.770
NW, thirty-four nautical miles. 
Estimated time of return is 0600.

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:22.130
Two hours till the torpedo squads return.

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.050
Get to the guns!

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:32.010
Is that what we're supposed to guard?

00:05:32.820 --> 00:05:35.730
I'm scared! I don't want to fight!

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:44.150
Paratroopers?

00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:45.400
They're here.

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:46.630
They're jumping out!

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:48.070
Seriously?

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:49.900
This is bad.

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:51.700
This is really bad, yes...

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:53.350
Everyone, hurry!

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:08.520
The city of Centezual...

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:27.880
No!

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:29.570
I want to go back to the dorm!

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:30.990
We're doomed!

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:33.080
We're all going to die here!

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:35.290
Everyone, snap out of it...

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:38.210
Do you want them to take 
over our school and town?

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:41.170
If we don't shoot, they'll just kill us.

00:06:44.010 --> 00:06:46.230
Sharon's right.

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:48.520
I won't sit here and let them kill me!

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:03.440
Everyone!

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:21.520
If you shoot like that, 
you'll dislocate your shoulder.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:24.140
You aren't cut out for this.

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:56.940
Amazing, Sharon...

00:07:56.940 --> 00:07:58.970
No, that was from the forest.

00:07:58.970 --> 00:07:59.790
The forest?

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:03.960
That's...

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:13.590
We're just sitting ducks out here!

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:16.750
We must break through and return to Escorial!

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:21.930
Single-file line... I'll take the lead!

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:23.940
Follow me, everyone!

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:33.160
I'll take the rear!

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:35.990
I'll keep them off us, even if it costs me my life!

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:38.260
Don't die, Wolf.

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:40.870
I can't make the Ari-men without you.

00:08:42.990 --> 00:08:45.050
I just eat it!

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:46.670
Marco, don't you die, either!

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:48.710
We're risking our lives here.

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:50.940
Don't screw up, no matter what!

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:52.280
I know...

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:54.800
I haven't whined once today!

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:57.300
Yeah, I'm surprised, too.

00:08:58.210 --> 00:09:01.310
Today, you're kinda cool, stupid little brother.

00:09:01.740 --> 00:09:05.640
This isn't the time, stupid little sister.

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:30.790
Let's help Fausto!

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:32.820
Kal, show me your guts!

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:33.880
Got it!

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:51.440
Not bad.

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:53.820
Same to you.

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:05.330
A silver...

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:06.460
fox?

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.220
Fausto?

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:22.830
Kal! Stay focused!

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:24.600
We're still surrounded by the enemy!

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:26.610
We have to survive at any cost...

00:10:26.610 --> 00:10:28.440
That's all we can do for Fausto!

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:33.370
Ari, up ahead!

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:50.510
Wolfgang!

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:53.750
Don't worry... I don't regret a thing!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:59.100
Take this!

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:29.140
I won't lose.

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:31.830
I refuse to lose!

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:37.010
Th-The silver fox... To the rear left.

00:11:37.010 --> 00:11:38.420
He's matched our altitude!

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:39.460
Ari!

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:40.760
On it!

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:42.680
Right!

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:47.140
Now the left!

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:48.500
Left!

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:52.520
Damn it...

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:54.350
Ari, how much damage did we take?

00:11:56.970 --> 00:11:58.470
Ari!

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:01.640
We still can't see the enemy?

00:12:01.640 --> 00:12:03.760
No enemies within visual range.

00:12:03.760 --> 00:12:06.070
Ten minutes until we enter the combat area.

00:12:07.110 --> 00:12:08.950
What's happening with Isla?

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:11.930
The enemy paratroopers are 
fighting our ground forces.

00:12:11.930 --> 00:12:13.370
We're winning.

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:16.710
But we've lost control of the airspace 
over zones one through four!

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:20.480
We can't win with only trainees and escorts!

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:22.510
Damn it!

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:26.140
Get that fire out!

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:28.350
Anyone who can, help!

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:30.020
Get the planes outside!

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:31.430
Do you want them to burn?

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:33.310
Where are our escorts?

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:34.690
We can't fight them off with just AA guns!

00:12:37.260 --> 00:12:38.150
Ignacio?

00:12:38.490 --> 00:12:41.110
If we take off in them, the bombing 
won't destroy them.

00:12:48.820 --> 00:12:50.660
Ari, wake up...

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:52.290
This isn't funny!

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:53.660
It's not funny.

00:12:54.470 --> 00:12:57.000
We're going back to Velasquez...

00:12:57.310 --> 00:12:59.500
To Father and to our sisters!

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:02.760
We're going to find the End of the Sky,

00:13:03.490 --> 00:13:06.460
become real pilots, and return...

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:09.400
Right, Ari?!

00:13:12.340 --> 00:13:13.140
You're in the way!

00:13:13.610 --> 00:13:15.850
I'm talking with Ari right now!

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:20.360
Ari, I need you...

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:26.420
I won't let you die.

00:13:26.420 --> 00:13:28.780
I can't live without you!

00:13:33.030 --> 00:13:35.000
Please, Ari...

00:13:35.530 --> 00:13:37.500
I'll be your little brother...

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:39.920
I'll give you my life!

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:43.800
So please, wake up!

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:46.220
Ari!

00:13:54.470 --> 00:13:55.100
Ari!

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:57.940
Keep your eyes to the front.

00:13:57.940 --> 00:13:59.670
Ari! Ari!

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:00.110
Ari!

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:02.100
Calm down, idiot.

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:03.420
Look in front of you.

00:14:11.930 --> 00:14:14.670
Thank you, god!

00:14:15.890 --> 00:14:17.910
Ari! Ari!

00:14:18.390 --> 00:14:21.120
Kal, listen...

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:23.300
The blood isn't stopping.

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:25.590
R-Right.

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:30.870
I don't think I can stay awake much longer...

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:33.100
Got it. Just stay put, Ari.

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:35.600
I'll get us back to everyone.

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:37.820
I'm sorry...

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:42.090
It's fine... Believe in me!

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:44.150
I won't lose!

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:57.750
That crazy flying... Is that him?

00:15:08.610 --> 00:15:09.740
Why?

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:11.890
Kal-el!

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:15.930
I'm sorry, Ari...

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:18.150
We were so close...

00:15:20.150 --> 00:15:24.310
I was so sure I'd find the 
End of the Sky with you.

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:29.720
I can't die here.

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:48.000
A single-seat fighter?

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:51.180
A seagull?

00:16:20.090 --> 00:16:21.750
Wow.

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:36.960
Escorial!

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:37.850
We did it!

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:39.440
We're back, Ari!

00:16:55.980 --> 00:17:00.040
Even if you can't use your power, 
you're still Nina Viento.

00:17:01.100 --> 00:17:02.830
We're returning to Van Whyl.

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:07.900
The <i>Luna Barco</i> and torpedo planes 
have entered the Isla combat zone.

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:09.040
They've begun combat.

00:17:10.070 --> 00:17:12.200
Somehow, we made it...

00:17:25.670 --> 00:17:27.730
What a mess.

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:34.320
But at least we didn't lose Isla, I guess.

00:17:35.020 --> 00:17:39.020
However, we have no way 
to receive new supplies.

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:44.550
When you consider what lies ahead, 
this is a pure defeat.

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:48.470
And...

00:17:49.870 --> 00:17:52.490
We paid far too great a price.

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:58.680
You want to protect Isla?

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:02.070
Wolf... Fausto...

00:18:03.050 --> 00:18:05.280
And now, you're hurt.

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:10.690
I'm a screw-up... But I have far 
too much self-confidence!

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:13.360
Even though I can't do anything alone...

00:18:21.010 --> 00:18:23.110
Jeez, shut up.

00:18:24.140 --> 00:18:25.780
A-Ari?

00:18:25.780 --> 00:18:28.070
Don't mumble over my bed.

00:18:28.070 --> 00:18:29.750
I can't sleep.

00:18:30.390 --> 00:18:31.340
Sorry.

00:18:31.780 --> 00:18:34.330
That was a good nap.

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:37.900
I think I might have slept a bit too long...

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:42.330
You can sit here.

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:44.980
No, I'm fine...

00:18:45.510 --> 00:18:46.850
Sit.

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:48.620
You haven't rested at all, have you?

00:18:48.620 --> 00:18:50.760
You can rest now.

00:18:50.760 --> 00:18:51.540
But...

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:52.370
Shut up!

00:18:52.370 --> 00:18:54.440
That's an order... Sit.

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:56.940
Fine.

00:18:57.680 --> 00:19:00.950
I'm not that hurt.

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:02.860
Ari...

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:07.940
It doesn't bother me at all.

00:19:07.940 --> 00:19:11.310
I'm sure Wolf and Fausto feel the same.

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:14.700
Everyone fought because they wanted to...

00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:19.560
I'm sad that they died.

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:25.060
But we can't be scared and beaten forever.

00:19:26.550 --> 00:19:29.900
So don't give up, Kal-el Albus!

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:32.560
You don't have to blame yourself...

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:38.700
Instead, work hard, so you 
can fly better next time!

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:40.860
Ari...

00:19:48.010 --> 00:19:50.320
Hey, Kal... Did you notice?

00:19:51.720 --> 00:19:57.630
While you were dodging that 
silver fox, I was awake.

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:05.770
I heard your little poem in 
the midst of the battle.

00:20:08.820 --> 00:20:10.780
What are you talking about?!

00:20:10.780 --> 00:20:13.200
Like, "I'm fine with being your little brother,"

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:16.120
and "I can't live without you."

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:17.290
I didn't say that...

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:19.250
I n-never said anything like that!

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:20.860
You're stupid.

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:24.040
Thanks, big brother.

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:27.590
Big brother!

00:20:27.590 --> 00:20:29.450
S-Stop that, dummy...

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:31.700
C-Call me your little brother.

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:34.040
You were pretty cool, big brother.

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:36.870
I guess you're done being a screw-up.

00:20:36.870 --> 00:20:39.420
I'm y-your little brother.

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:41.140
I'm fine being a screw-up.

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:45.750
Big brother...

00:20:55.140 --> 00:20:56.290
I...

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:02.110
The fighter, of unknown nationality,

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:05.150
that appeared during the last 
fight left a message tube.

00:21:05.150 --> 00:21:09.120
We have translated its contents.

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:10.170
What does it say?

00:21:11.880 --> 00:21:15.080
"We people share the same blood.

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:17.630
There are others, as well.

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:22.240
And all are called the Seeds of Saint Aldista."

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:25.460
Saint Aldista...

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:29.370
Then they have the same myths as ours?

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:32.410
"We do not know each other,

00:21:32.410 --> 00:21:35.500
but we would like to help one another,

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:37.660
and solve this world's secrets together."

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:40.570
That's the import of it.

00:21:43.890 --> 00:21:47.890
At the bottom is a seal thought 
to belong to an emperor,

00:21:47.890 --> 00:21:50.780
along with the author's name.

00:21:52.230 --> 00:21:57.930
"The Holy Levamme Empire's 
High Consul Fana Levamme."

00:23:31.740 --> 00:23:33.010
It's me, Ignacio.

00:23:33.340 --> 00:23:37.010
A joint memorial is held for those 
who lost their lives in the battle.

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:38.640
I guess he survived,

00:23:38.640 --> 00:23:39.890
but he figured out who Claire—

00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:41.040
<b>Episode 9 
Your Name</b>
